  "answer": "CD-10411: Hello,\n\nThank you for reaching out. To help you reset your password, please follow these steps:\n\n1. Go to the CloudDesk login page.\n2. Click on the \"Forgot Password\" option.\n3. Enter your current username or email address.\n4. Follow the instructions provided to generate a new password.\n\nOnce you have completed these steps, you will need to log back into CloudDesk using your new password. Please note that once you reset your password, you won't be able to access any previous sessions unless you set up two-factor authentication.\n\nIf you encounter any issues during the process, feel free to reach out again. We're here to assist you.\n\nBest regards,\n[Your Name]\nCloudDesk Support Team",
